What is CNI?
CNI stands for Container Network Interface.

It provides the networking infrastructure required for Pods to communicate.

Without a functioning CNI plugin, Pods will not have the required network connectivity.

There are several CNI solutions:
CNI	Description
Flannel	Simple Pod networking
Calico	Networking and network policies
Cilium	eBPF-based networking and security
Weave Net	Legacy networking solution


We are using Flannel for our practical
